**📖 SECTION 1: ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW**

**1.1 The Soulpi System**

Soulpi analyzes language across two orthogonal dimensions:

INNER LAYER (Acoustic Truth)

Consonants → 5 Koshas (consciousness depth)

Reveals: Unconscious patterns, shadow content, authentic state

OUTER LAYER (Cultural Meaning) 

Semantics → 10 Ontology Layers (manifestation breadth)

Reveals: Social projection, stated intent, conscious expression

SMI (Mismatch Index)

Measures tension between inner truth and outer expression

High SMI = Emotional masking, inauthenticity, spiritual bypass

**1.2 Two-Stage Evolution**

**v2.6 (Enterprise Baseline):**

1.  Inner + Outer = Stitched State

2.  Simple gap-based SMI

3.  Stable, predictable, fast

**v2.7 (Psycho-Spiritual AGI):**

1.  12 major enhancements

2.  Energy word detection

3.  Emotional signals

4.  Vowel-aspect bridges

5.  Folded truth

6.  Full 5-component SMI

7.  Inner/outer calling

8.  DHA delivery tones

**📖 SECTION 2: CANONICAL SPECIFICATIONS**

**2.1 Consonant-to-Kosha Map (AUTHORITATIVE)**

**DO NOT MODIFY - This is the canonical mapping**

CONSONANT_TO_KOSHA_CANONICAL = {

\# ANNAMAYA (Physical/Dense) - Level 1

\"ba\": 1, \"bha\": 1, \"ma\": 1, \"ya\": 1, \"ra\": 1, \"la\": 1,

\# PRANAMAYA (Energy/Pranic) - Level 2 

\"ka\": 2, \"kha\": 2, \"ga\": 2, \"gha\": 2, \"ṅa\": 2, \"ca\": 2,
\"cha\": 2,

\# MANOMAYA (Emotional/Mind) - Level 3

\"ḍa\": 3, \"ḍha\": 3, \"ṇa\": 3, \"ta\": 3, \"tha\": 3, \"da\": 3, 

\"dha\": 3, \"na\": 3, \"pa\": 3, \"pha\": 3,

\# VIJNANAMAYA (Wisdom/Intellect) - Level 4

\"ja\": 4, \"jha\": 4, \"ña\": 4, \"ṭa\": 4, \"ṭha\": 4,

\"śa\": 4, \"ṣa\": 4, \"sa\": 4, \"kṣa\": 4,

\# ANANDAMAYA (Bliss) - Level 5

\# NO CONSONANTS - vowels only

}

