**📖 SECTION 5: API SPECIFICATION**

**Unified Endpoint**

\@app.post(\"/soulpi/analyze\")

def analyze(text: str, mode: str = \"v2.7\", HD=0.0, HG=0.0, HK=0.0):

\"\"\"

Modes: \"v2.6\", \"v2.7\", \"hybrid\"

\"\"\"

if mode == \"v2.6\":

return stitch_sentence_v26(text, HD, HG, HK)

elif mode == \"v2.7\":

return analyze_sentence_v27(text, HD, HG, HK)

elif mode == \"hybrid\":

return {\"v26\": \..., \"v27\": \...}

**📖 SECTION 6: KEY ALGORITHMS**

**v2.6 Stitching Formula**

STITCHED = 0.45·INNER + 0.45·OUTER -- 0.10·GAP + 0.05·ENTROPY

**v2.7 Full SMI**

SMI = w1·base_gap + w2·entropy + w3·stability + w4·aspect_gap +
w5·cosmic_gap

